Id: pass015w
Severity: WARN
Category: accounts
Check: check_passwd
Fix: Set a shell from /etc/shells, or /usr/sbin/nologin for an account that never logs in.
References: shells(5); usermod(8)
Controls: CIS 5.1, 5.2; NIST AC-2, IA-5(1); ISO 5.16, 5.17; CE User access control

The listed login ID does not have a valid login program or shell.
Usually these are defined in /etc/shells.
